WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.994
SUBSTRING is useful when character position has a
documented meaning For

00:00:06.007 --> 00:00:09.915
example we may take the first three characters of a
product name to build a

00:00:09.942 --> 00:00:15.650
teaching code But fixed positions can be fragile
when string structures

00:00:15.676 --> 00:00:21.410
vary Use position-based extraction only when the
structure is stable

00:00:21.423 --> 00:00:22.660
enough to justify it
